OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy
OL,6,Fafternoon conditions likely to persist
OL,7,Finto this evening with the risk of
OL,8,Fshowers increasing, as a band of
OL,9,Fshower rain arrives from the
OL,10,Fnorthwest. This likely to clear by
OL,11,Fdawn with variable cloud and some
OL,12,Fclear spells developing.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FThursday will be a fresher
OL,15,Fday with a gentle northwesterly wind.
OL,16,FThere will be some pleasantly warm
OL,17,Fspells of sunshine, though the odd
OL,18,Flight shower cannot be ruled out.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
